    "body": "Maintainer decision, 2026-11-22, given in the question dialog.\n\nAt a dead end of a later pass of 2D Offset with \"Pass starts at: Outside\", the tool enters with **a ramp along the pass**. Option 1 of the worker's comment.\n\nRules for the work:\n- The ramp lowers the tool while it travels along the pass. The cut engages in a gradual way.\n- The late-entry pin is narrowed to count only plunges and helices into stock. A ramp along the pass is not one of them.\n- Climb milling stays. The full-width rule (no flat feed wider than one stepover) stays.\n- The workaround \"Pass starts at: Auto\" stays until the fix merges.\n- The pin `outside_entries_after_the_first_land_in_cleared_stock` must go green at 0.00 mm2. The held work on `issue/3567-outside-later-entry` (option A) is not for merge.\n",
    "author_association": "OWNER",
